unattractive. I guess that is what I've been trying to say the whole time.
For me, that is simply not something that interest me much.

If I implement NFS, I would definitely want to be able to access remote 
files in the same way as local files, even if they were created on the 
remote file system.

Or atleast be interoperable as far as possible. And for instance text 
files is possible to get interoperable, but it's a lot of fiddling to do it.

