labeled with Digital stickers, there are only certain ones which are 
Alpha-compatible and which suits the PWS. There has been lots of timing 
issues with inferior memory in Alphas. An Alpha needs very fast memory 
and it must be of good quality. You get reliable results with the 
supported parts. It is not just a question of marketing.


