I haven't looked at PDP-11 boot ROMs lately, but it might be that
somewhat less than the whole controller is needed to boot.

Otherwise, as was often done in days long past, you can implement
your own boot ROMs to match your controller.

The common IDE interface for the ISA bus is just bus buffers
