> build a disk controller, but it will not actually be usable for any of 
> the systems mentioned.

Well, while booting RSX would be nice, I don't expect to ever actually be
able to use RSX (or my favorite RSTS) as a hobbyist so, it becomes much
less of a concern.  I would expect that support for BSD would be possible,
even booting but it's still along ways from that.  Just running ideas thru
my head at the moment and looking for people comments.

> 
